lling is available, so the outlook rests on the district's lean, the incumbent's financial and visibility advantages, and the consensus among professional raters, all of which point to a comfortable Democratic hold.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9759, "margin": 13.77}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9787, "margin": 14.5}]}